  If you want a copy of Nethack 3.0 Patchlevel 4, there is a zoo file
on lampwick.berkeley.edu (128.32.131.141) which contains the complete
Nethack 3.0 with all patches up to Patchlevel 4 installed in it (not
including the extra shopkeeper fix which was posted).  You need Zoo
to extract it - this program is available at several FTP sites.  Also
there are some Patchlevel 1 Nethack 3.0 executables for the IBM PC.  I
haven't been able to get a good Patchlevel 4 with decent features yet, but
when I do it will appear on there too.

